  "name": "Benthic Invertebrate Literature on the Bering Sea and Chukchi Sea Ecosystem Database",
  "description": "Database of literature from Benthic invertebrate field research in the Bering Sea and Chukchi Sea. Citations are indexed by geographical area, sampling methods, taxa, sampling cruise and year. Where applicable, citations are cross-referenced by similar data sources, author and National Oceanographic Data Center track number. This Database complements the Bering and Chukchi Sea Benthic Invertebrate database.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: A report on the Benthic Invertebrate Literature on the Bering Sea and Chukchi Sea Ecosystem Database",
